  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Significant climate change challenges hinder effective forest management in Armenia. To tackle these issues and support the country&#x2019;s international commitments, the project combines Switzerland&apos;s expertise in climate adaptation and forestry with the experience of local NGOs&apos; in forestry. This collaboration aims to strengthen the capacities of public institutions and communities in sustainable management, monitoring, and restoration of forests, as well as in climate-resilient agroforestry.</narrative>
  </description>
